  "description": "A FluentValidation adapter for CQRSharp. One line of setup makes every registered FluentValidation IValidator<TRequest> run inside CQRSharp's validation pipeline behavior, alongside any native IRequestValidator<TRequest>; Error-severity failures are reported through RequestValidationException. FluentValidation compiles expression trees at runtime, so this package is not Native-AOT or full-trim compatible.",
